     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: TestPlan eu-api-resource-consumer-tests</b></p><a name=\"eu-api-resource-consumer-tests\"> </a><a name=\"hceu-api-resource-consumer-tests\"> </a><p><b>Scopes</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Reference</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td><code>http://hl7.eu/fhir/health-data-api/ActorDefinition/resource-consumer-actor-eu-api</code></td><td>The Resource Consumer, a client that reads patient resources from a Resource Access Provider, is the system under test. The test bed plays the provider.</td></tr></table><p><b>1 Suite: SMART Backend Services authorization</b></p><p>Rule: SMART Backend Services authorization — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-resource-consumer.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>rc-001 The SUT authenticates with a signed JWT client assertion (RFC 7523)</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rc-001 (input bindings and expected data). Covers security.smart-backend-services.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>2 Suite: Patient lookup</b></p><p>Rule: Patient lookup — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-resource-consumer.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>rc-002 The SUT searches Patient by the identifier parameter</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rc-002 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Patient.search-type, Patient.search.identifier.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rc-003 The SUT reads the patient by logical id</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rc-003 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Patient.read.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>3 Suite: Search by patient</b></p><p>Rule: Search by patient — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-resource-consumer.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>rc-004 The SUT searches Condition by the patient parameter</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rc-004 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Condition.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rc-005 The SUT searches Observation by patient and category</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rc-005 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Observation.search.patient, Observation.search.category, Observation.search.code, Observation.search.date.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rc-006 The SUT searches AllergyIntolerance by the patient parameter</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rc-006 (input bindings and expected data). Covers AllergyIntolerance.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>4 Suite: Transport security</b></p><p>Rule: Transport security — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-resource-consumer.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>rc-007 